  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Small cohort (n=25) but the only publicly available T1D dataset with granular bolus breakdown (dose, type, correction amounts) combined with AID device mode context. CC BY 4.0 with no restrictions. Peer-reviewed at IEEE-EMBS BSN 2025. Assess for ML teams building glucose prediction, digital twin, or personalised AID models who need bolus-level detail beyond what OhioT1DM or TCIA provide.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-15",
